  «text (0,5200) 1.6 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿SHUFFLER 1 - converter between PV1+ (T) and PV3+ (B) with the midpoint on PV2+ (M): the hand-drawn v3 power stage"Â»
  «text (0,4800) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Leg A = M3 / M4 (driver X6, PWM_AH / PWM_AL), leg B = M1 / M2 (driver X7, PWM_BH / PWM_BL); X4 = ERUC23 inverse-coupled inductor."Â»
  «text (0,4600) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Board capacitors C1 / C3 (130 uF) and C5 (225 nF); V13 = 0 V midpoint sense; V4 (A) and V7 (B) = 0 V sources in the windings, positive into the midpoint."Â»
  «text (0,4400) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Ports: T / M / B = the converter rails (cable and copper inductances are on the top sheet); PWM_* = 3.3 V logic from the Controller block;"Â»
  «text (0,4200) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿HS_A / HS_B = TMCS1126 hall-sensor outputs to the Controller (1.65 V + 100 mV/A on A, 1.65 V - 25 mV/A on B: reversed as mounted on the board)."Â»
  «text (0,4000) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Measure the winding currents from the top sheet as I(V4â€¢XS1) and I(V7â€¢XS1); their difference is the circulating current, their sum the shuffled current."Â»
  «text (3000,-3700) 1.2 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿TMCS1126 HALL SENSORS - on the board at the inductor; 1k + 318.3p = the 500 kHz output pole"Â»
